    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tenedumunye oloiboni tiatua intae, aashu olaidetidetani loo nkidetidetat, neisho intae enkitoduaata aashu embae e nking'asia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nelotu ina kitoduaata aashu ina bae e nking'asia natiaka ninye intae aaku, naa tenejo ninye, ‘Maape iyiook aasujaa kulie aitin apa neitu intae iyiolouu, naa maisiaayia iyiook ninche,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nimining'ining'i intae lelo rorei leilo oiboni aashu ilo aidetidetani loo nkidetidetat; amu ketem, intae Olaitoriani Enkai inyi, pee eyiolou tenaa inyorrinyorro intae Olaitoriani Enkai inyi to ltauja linyi pooki o te nkishui inyi pooki ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shomo iyie tudumunye tusujai Olaitoriani Enkai ino niureyu ninye, nimbung nkitanapat enyena nining oltoilo lenye, nisiai ninye nimbung'are ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore ilo oiboni aashu ilo aidetidetani loo nkidetidetat neari metua, amu eiteng'enishe ninye engolong'akinoto tialo Olaitoriani Enkai ino, ilo laa ninye likiyaua iyie aitupuku tiatua enkop e Misiri, nikikordu ninye iyie aitung'uaa enkaji esinkaisho, pee kitum aitung'uai ina oitoi nikintanapa Olaitoriani Enkai ino pee iim. Neaku iwuang'ie iyie entorroni te mpolos inyi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tenikiliki alej aitapong'oo olalashe lino ling'arie kina, aashu olayioni lino, aashu entito ino, aashu ina kitok ino ninyor, aashu ilo shore lino linyor anaa kewan ino, ejo, ‘Maape iyiook aaisiaai kulie aitin; neitu aekata iyiolouu intae aashu iloo papaai linyi,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore embata e nena aitin e lelo tung'ana oo manita intae, etaaniki intae aashu elamita intae, ebaiki eluboto nabo enkop o metabaiki enkae luboto, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "misujaa iyie ninye nimimbung ninye, nimincho meing'urrie ninye, nimipal iyie ninye nimimitu iyie ninye ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kake taara iyie ninye metua inchoo eaku enkaina ino naituruk near ninye metua, ore te siadi naa nkaik oo ltung'ana pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanang'a iyie ninye too soito metua, enkaraki niking'orua ninye aitapong'oo to Laitoriani Enkai ino, laa ninye likiyaua aitupuku te nkop e Misiri aitupuku tiatua enkaji e sinkaisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pee ening Iltung'ana pooki le Israel, neureishoyu, nemeigil aekata aas entorroni naikununo nji tiatua intae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tenining iyie te nabo e nena anas nikincho iyie Olaitoriani Enkai tobikie teine, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nchere eshomo kulikae tung'ana le pesho tiatua intae neitapong'oitie lelo oomanya ina anasa, ejo, ‘Maape iyiook aaisiaai kulie aitin,’ neitu apa iyiolouu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nitumokiki taa aaikilikuanu nikililitu aaitirrishaki; naa ng'ura tenaa kesipa neibale nchere etaasaki ena toki nadiaa tiatua intae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niariara naa aamut lelo oomanya ina anasa to lalem, nindaikiekie katukul lelo pooki ootii atua o nchoorei enyena, te nepi olalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nisotisoto nena masaa pooki aapik empolos e boo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13.16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "empolos e boo",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "olosinko",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nipejoo ina anasa o nena yarunot enyena pooki te nkima, anaa olasar olulung'a opejokini Olaitoriani Enkai inyi, neaku osototi ntarasi, meigili aekata aashet ina anasa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mintinyikaki ake enkaina ino nena tokitin nemenyikakini pee etum Olaitoriani aibelekenyayu teina goro enye napi, neisho intae olng'ur neitanana oshoke tialo intae, anaa apa enainosie ninye olmumai too loo papaai linyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tenining'ining'i intae oltoilo lo Laitoriani Enkai inyi, aaibung nena kitanapat pooki naitanap nanu intae ena olong, niasiasa ina sidai naishiakino too nkonyek o Laitoriani Enkai inyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
